<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-154.2-customer-loan-origination-underwriting-and-closing" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4561" name="W4561. Customer Identification, Finance-Need Discovery &amp; Pre-Qualification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer inquiry (store/trade/field); project quote (VS-66)
Frequency: Per customer inquiry (high volume at 200 stores + trade)
Volume: Finance inquiries across B2C homeowners + B2B trade
Owner: Finance Desk / Sales Associate / Field Sales (VS-140)
Participants: Trade (VS-11), Project Design (VS-66), Insights (VS-44), Lenders
Source: workflow W4561 — Customer Identification, Finance-Need Discovery &amp; Pre-Qualification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4561_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4561_Lane1" name="Finance Desk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4561_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4561_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4561_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4561_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4561_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4561_Start3" name="Customer inquiry (store/trade/field); project quote (VS-66)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4561_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4561_Task4" name="Finance Desk/Sales identify the finance need (home build/renovation, project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Desk/Sales identify the finance need (home build/renovation, project size, timeline, affordability sense) during the sales/project conversation (VS-66/VS-11)
Responsible (R): Finance Desk / Sales
Accountable (A): Store Manager / Trade Manager
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4561_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4561_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4561_Task5" name="Finance Desk conduct soft pre-qualification (income/credit profile, indicative…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Desk conduct soft pre-qualification (income/credit profile, indicative eligibility per W4556) WITHOUT a hard credit pull (privacy VS-91), and present product options
Responsible (R): Finance Desk
Accountable (A): Finance Desk Lead
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4561_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4561_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4561_Task6" name="Finance Desk route qualified interest to application (W4562) with customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance Desk route qualified interest to application (W4562) with customer consent, and capture the lead in CRM (VS-13/VS-107) for follow-up/analytics (W4575)
Responsible (R): Finance Desk / CRM
Accountable (A): Finance Desk Lead
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4561_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4561_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4561_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4561_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4561_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-693 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Loan Origination, Underwriting &amp; Closing (PA-154.2).) | - CTL-693: pre-qualification indicative-only (no approval promise); soft (consented) pre-qual; lead captured (VS-13)
Owner: Finance Desk / Sales Associate / Field Sales (VS-140)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4561_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4561_Annotation8" targetRef="W4561_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4561_Flow10" sourceRef="W4561_Start3" targetRef="W4561_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4561_Flow11" sourceRef="W4561_Task4" targetRef="W4561_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4561_Flow12" sourceRef="W4561_Task5" targetRef="W4561_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4561_Flow13" sourceRef="W4561_Task6" targetRef="W4561_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4561_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4561_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4561">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4561_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4561_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
