      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: First draw released (W4567); loan active
Frequency: Per loan
Volume: Project activations across financed projects
Owner: Project Design (VS-66) / Trade (VS-11) / Installation (VS-12)
Participants: Finance Desk, Stores (VS-07), Logistics (VS-06), CRM (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4568 — Post-Closing Handoff, Project Activation &amp; Material Release</bpmn:documentation>
