      <bpmn:userTask id="W4568_Task5" name="Finance Desk/Project Design hand off the financed project to execution (VS-66…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Desk/Project Design hand off the financed project to execution (VS-66 design→VS-12 install/VS-11 supply), confirming funding is active (W4567)
Responsible (R): Finance Desk / Project Design
Accountable (A): Project Design Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4568_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4568_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4568_Task6" name="Trade/Stores/Logistics release materials/services against the funded project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade/Stores/Logistics release materials/services against the funded project (VS-11/VS-07/VS-06), billing per the draw schedule (W4567)
Responsible (R): Trade / Stores / Logistics
Accountable (A): Trade Manager / Store Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4568_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4568_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4568_Task7" name="Finance Desk/CRM track project progress &amp; loan draw (W4567), capture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance Desk/CRM track project progress &amp; loan draw (W4567), capture satisfaction/ basket (VS-44/W4575), and manage the relationship to completion
Responsible (R): Finance Desk / CRM
Accountable (A): Finance Desk Lead
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4568_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4568_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4568_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4568_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
