        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-693 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Loan Origination, Underwriting &amp; Closing (PA-154.2).) | - CTL-693: materials released only on confirmed funding (W4567); billing per draw schedule; project scope controlled (VS-66)
Owner: Project Design (VS-66) / Trade (VS-11) / Installation (VS-12)</bpmn:text>
